---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import Bouton from '../../components/Bouton.astro';
import { chemin } from '../../i18n/routes';
---

<Base
  page="accueil"
  langue="en"
  titre="Jean Perrier"
  description="Jean Perrier's portfolio, in two product projects: listening to user feedback, then acting on content quality."
>
  <section class="conteneur accroche">
    <h1>I build on hypotheses: I listen, I test, then I size the effort.</h1>
  </section>

  <section class="conteneur" id="projets" aria-labelledby="titre-projets">
    <h2 id="titre-projets">Projects</h2>
    <ol class="projets">
      <li class="projet">
        <span class="projet__numero" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
        <h3><Bouton variante="tertiaire" href={chemin('uservoice', 'en')}>UserVoice</Bouton></h3>
        <p>1 in 3 pieces of feedback concerns the content.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="projet">
        <span class="projet__numero" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
        <h3><Bouton variante="tertiaire" href={chemin('auditContenu', 'en')}>Content audit</Bouton></h3>
        <p>On the first audited path, 1 question in 20 kept learners from answering. All of them were fixed.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </section>
</Base>
